                                                                                
*                                                                               
*  FUNKTION   :  PGM-SKAPAR EN LISTA ÖVER TILLÄGGSTEXTER                        
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  GUNNEL ERIKSSON    880825                                      
*                                                                               
*  INFILER    :  W15112D1                                                       
*                                                                               
*  UTFILER    :  W15112D2                                                       
*                                                                               
*  ÄNDRING    :  - ÄNDRAT TILL EPLUS FRÅN REPORT WRITER                         
*  ÄNDRING    :  - TILLAGT DD-KORT FÖR PV-LISTAN         911023                 
*                                                                               
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVD                                  
*     890605..    CONNY EGHOLT........     36210.........                       
*     911023..    CONNY EGHOLT........     30621.........                       
*     ........    ....................     ..............                       
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*--------------------------INFIL------------------------------------            
  FILE  W15112D1                                                                
*                                                                               
 %W15109EE 'IN-'                                                                
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*------------------------SORTFIL------------------------------------            
  FILE  W15112DS    FB (61 6222)                                                
*                                                                               
 %W15109EE 'SORT-'                                                              
*-------------------------PRINTFIL----------------------------------            
FILE W15112D4 PRINTER                                                           
*                      LISTA TILL PV                                            
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
 W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA                               W  28 A                        
   W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA-IDSKYLT  W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA     3 A                         
   W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA-BETTEXT  W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA +3 25 A                         
*                                                                               
 W-25-ASTERISKER            W 25 A  VALUE +                                     
 '*************************'                                                    
*                                                                               
 W-IDSKYLT                  W  3 A                                              
 W-SPRAK                    W 12 A                                              
 W-KDPRTVAL                 W  1 A                                              
*                                                                               
 %WWLANDEE                                                                      
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-KOD IDSKYLT 3 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (IX)                                  
*                                                                               
 %WWSPRAK2                                                                      
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-TEXT SPRAK 24 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (IX)                                  
 SPRAK-SPRAK SPRAK-TEXT 12 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                           
*                                                                               
*--------------------COPY-TEXT--------------------------------------            
 %WTXTAREA                                                                      
*                                                                               
*--------------------LIST-POST--------------------------------------            
 LIST-TTEXT-IDTTEXNR       W  5 N MASK 'ZZZZZ'                                  
 LIST-TTEXT-FLOVERSATT    W  1 A                                                
 LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1     W 25 A                                                
 LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2     W 25 A                                                
 LIST-TTEXT-ASTERISK      W  7 A                                                
 LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-1       W 12 A                                                
 LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-2       W 12 A                                                
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOB1        *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
 SORT W15112D1 TO W15112DS USING +                                              
  (IN-TTEXT-IDSKYLT-1 IN-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1) +                                     
 BEFORE SORT-PROC                                                               
*                                                                               
  SORT-PROC                                                                     
  PROC                                                                          
    IF W15112D1                                                                 
          W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA-IDSKYLT  = IN-TTEXT-IDSKYLT-1                       
          W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA-BETTEXT  = IN-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1                       
          RTXT-TETEXTTR = W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA                                     
          RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                   
          CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                       
          IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                  
                W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA  = RTXT-TETEXTTR                              
                IN-TTEXT-IDSKYLT-1 = W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA-IDSKYLT                  
                IN-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1 = W-TTEXT-HJÄLPAREA-BETTEXT                  
          END-IF                                                                
          SELECT                                                                
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-PROC                                                                      
*                                                                               
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOB2        *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
 JOB INPUT  W15112DS                                                            
 LIST-TTEXT-IDTTEXNR = SORT-TTEXT-IDTTEXNR                                      
 W-KDPRTVAL = SORT-TTEXT-KDPRTVAL                                               
*                                                                               
    S-IX = 1                                                                    
*                                                                               
 IF SORT-TTEXT-FLOVERSATT = 'N'                                                 
    LIST-TTEXT-FLOVERSATT = SORT-TTEXT-FLOVERSATT                               
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
 W-IDSKYLT =  SORT-TTEXT-IDSKYLT-1                                              
 PERFORM B-KOLLA-SPRAK                                                          
 LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-1  = W-SPRAK                                                  
                                                                                
 IF SORT-TTEXT-IDSKYLT-2 NE ' '                                                 
    W-IDSKYLT = SORT-TTEXT-IDSKYLT-2                                            
    PERFORM B-KOLLA-SPRAK                                                       
    LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-2  = W-SPRAK                                               
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
 IF SORT-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1 = W-25-ASTERISKER                                      
    MOVE '*' TO LIST-TTEXT-ASTERISK FILL '*'                                    
 ELSE                                                                           
    RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1                                        
    RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                         
    CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                             
    IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                        
       LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1 = RTXT-TETEXTTR                                     
    END-IF                                                                      
 END-IF                                                                         
                                                                                
 IF SORT-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2 NE ' '                                                 
    IF SORT-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2 = W-25-ASTERISKER                                   
       MOVE '*' TO LIST-TTEXT-ASTERISK FILL '*'                                 
    ELSE                                                                        
       RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2                                     
       RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                      
       CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                          
       IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                     
          LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2 = RTXT-TETEXTTR                                  
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
 END-IF                                                                         
 IF W-KDPRTVAL = 'C'                                                            
   PRINT RAPPORT03                                                              
 END-IF                                                                         
 PERFORM C-NOLLSTÄLL-RAD-1                                                      
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
B-KOLLA-SPRAK                                                                   
PROC                                                                            
IX = 1                                                                          
DO WHILE IX < 11                                                                
   IF SPRAK-KOD(IX) = W-IDSKYLT                                                 
      W-SPRAK = SPRAK-SPRAK(IX, S-IX)                                           
      IX = 10                                                                   
   END-IF                                                                       
   IX = IX + 1                                                                  
END-DO                                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
C-NOLLSTÄLL-RAD-1                                                               
PROC                                                                            
 LIST-TTEXT-IDTTEXNR         = +0                                               
 LIST-TTEXT-FLOVERSATT      = ' '                                               
 LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1       = ' '                                               
 LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2       = ' '                                               
 LIST-TTEXT-ASTERISK        = ' '                                               
 LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-1         = ' '                                               
 LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-2         = ' '                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*-------------*                                                                 
* REPORT C    *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
  REPORT RAPPORT03 PRINTER W15112D4 +                                           
                    LINESIZE 120  +                                             
                    NOADJUST      +                                             
                    NOHEADING     +                                             
                    NODATE NOPAGE                                               
                                                                                
         CONTROL  FINAL NOPRINT  +                                              
                                                                                
  TITLE 1 COL 4 'W15112-001 /VOLVO CAR AFTERSALES./ ' +                         
         COL 41 'LISTA ÖVER TILLÄGGSTEXTER, BOKSTAVSORDNING' +                  
         COL  90 'DATUM:' +                                                     
         COL  96  SYSDATE                                                       
                                                                                
  TITLE 4 COL   4 'TILLÄGGSTEXTER-NR'   +                                       
         COL  24 'Ö' +                                                          
         COL  30  LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-1 +                                          
         COL  43  '------------' +                                              
         COL  60  LIST-TTEXT-SPRAK-2 +                                          
         COL  73  '------------' +                                              
         COL 100 'ÖVERSÄTTNING SAKNAS'                                          
                                                                                
  LINE  1 COL   4 LIST-TTEXT-IDTTEXNR     +                                     
          COL  24 LIST-TTEXT-FLOVERSATT  +                                      
          COL  30 LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-1   +                                      
          COL  60 LIST-TTEXT-BETTEXT-2   +                                      
          COL 112 LIST-TTEXT-ASTERISK                                           
                                                                                
  LINE  2     ' '                                                               
*                                                                               
